    <div class="guide"><span><strong id="guide-error">Errors</strong> <span id="guide-error-text">need attention first.</span> <strong id="guide-warning">Warnings</strong> <span id="guide-warning-text">are important improvements.</span> <strong id="guide-info">Info</strong> <span id="guide-info-text">is useful context.</span></span><span id="score-note">No opaque SEO score is used.</span></div>
